This repository was reconstructed from a distributed NoteBot build and has
since been ported, reorganized, rebranded, tested, and extended. Major Lyra
changes include multi-version Stonecutter builds, settings and song-config
persistence, playback lifecycle refactoring, HUD improvements, a Mod Menu
music desk, seeking, and expanded automated tests.

